<div class="banner" style="background-image: url('/img/strona_eecmagenta_baner.jpg');">
  <div class="banner-content">
    <h1>We invest in start-ups</h1>
    <p>We finance the digitalization of energy and industry</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section-white">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">ABOUT US</h2>
    <p class="intro-text">EEC Magenta is an independent venture capital company managing two funds with a total capitalization of PLN 210 million. Investors in the Funds are Tauron Polska Energia SA, PFR Ventures Starter FIZ, PFR NCBR CVC FIZ and the management team.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-green">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title light">SECTOR SPECIALIZATION</h2>
    <div class="sectors-grid">

      <div class="sector-item">
        <img src="/img/ikona_energetyka.png" alt="Energy">
        <h4>Energy</h4>
        <p>new business models and services related to smart grid, energy storage, integration of conventional and distributed energy</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sector-item">
        <img src="/img/ikona_Industry_4.0_IoT.png" alt="Industry 4.0 and IoT">
        <h4>Industry 4.0 and IoT</h4>
        <p>measuring, control and automation management systems, safety management systems in industry and mining, micro-networks, autonomous networks, smart home, smart city, smart buildings, smart factory</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sector-item">
        <img src="/img/ikona_ICT_Cyberbezpieczenstwo.png" alt="ICT and Cybersecurity">
        <h4>ICT and Cybersecurity</h4>
        <p>industrial cybersecurity, new cloud services, products supporting digital sales and marketing channels, blockchain</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sector-item">
        <img src="/img/ikona_Efektywnosc_procesowa.png" alt="Process Efficiency">
        <h4>Process Efficiency</h4>
        <p>digital products and services optimizing industrial processes, services and products supporting energy, raw material and material efficiency of the economy</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sector-item">
        <img src="/img/ikona_Smart_Utilities_Smart_Infrastructure.png" alt="Smart Utilities and Smart Infrastructure">
        <h4>Smart Utilities and Smart Infrastructure</h4>
        <p>management of transmission and storage of fuels, water, heat, management of e-mobility infrastructure</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sector-item">
        <img src="/img/ikona_AI_Big_Data.png" alt="AI and Big Data">
        <h4>AI and Big Data</h4>
        <p>digitalization of sales and back-office processes (RPA), new products based on the analysis of large data sets</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sector-item">
        <img src="/img/ikona_Gospodarka_obiegu_zamkniętego.png" alt="Circular Economy">
        <h4>Circular Economy</h4>
        <p>cleantech, digital products and services and new business models supporting sustainable development and the green economy, solutions improving waste management and environmental protection</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sector-item">
        <img src="/img/ikona_Inzynieria_materialowa.png" alt="Materials Engineering">
        <h4>Materials Engineering</h4>
        <p>New materials increasing energy efficiency, supporting environmental protection</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-gray">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">FUND PARAMETERS</h2>
    <div class="params-grid">

      <div class="param-item">
        <img class="param-icon" src="/img/ikona_Kapitalizacja.png" alt="Capitalization">
        <p class="param-label">Capitalization</p>
        <p class="param-value">PLN 210 million</p>
      </div>

      <div class="param-item">
        <img class="param-icon" src="/img/ikona_wielkosc_inwestycji.png" alt="Investment size">
        <p class="param-label">Investment size</p>
        <p class="param-value">PLN 1–30 million</p>
      </div>

      <div class="param-item">
        <img class="param-icon" src="/img/ikona_etap_rozwoju.png" alt="Development stage">
        <p class="param-label">Development stage</p>
        <p class="param-value">seed, start-up, expansion</p>
      </div>

      <div class="param-item">
        <img class="param-icon" src="/img/ikona_horyzont_inwestycyjny.png" alt="Investment horizon">
        <p class="param-label">Investment horizon</p>
        <p class="param-value">up to 7 years</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="quote-section" style="background-image: url('/img/tlo_cytat.jpg');">
  <div class="quote-content">
    Bold leaders embrace the digitalization of their organizations. Innovators know what tools to propose. The key to long-term growth is connecting both sides.<br><br>
    – Konrad Sitnik - Partner EEC Ventures and EEC Magenta
  </div>
</div>

